### 6. Leaflet Map Requirements

Use Leaflet.js and OpenStreetMap tiles.

Implement:
- Click-to-select complaint location.
- Browser geolocation with explicit user permission.
- Latitude and longitude storage.
- Category-specific marker styling.
- Marker popups containing grievance title, category, status, and submission date.
- Filters by category, status, and date.
- Marker clustering only if needed.
- Responsive map layout.

Do not expose citizens' private addresses, phone numbers, or other personal information through public map markers. Display only public-safe grievance details.

